```console
$ scherzo-cloud account update --help
Update your account

Usage: scherzo-cloud account update [OPTIONS] <--display-name <NAME>|--clear-display-name>

Options:
      --display-name <NAME>            Set your account display name
      --clear-display-name             Clear your account display name
      --json                           Print the account result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

```
